<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Westpac sets US$5.0 bln Euro-MTN.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Westpac sets US$5.0 bln Euro-MTN.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Westpac Banking Corporation said on Monday it is establishing a US$5.0 billion Euro Medium Term note programme.  </p>
<p>The dealer group comprises Deutsche Morgan Grenfell, HSBC Markets, J.P. Morgan, Morgan Stanley International, Nomura International, Westpac Banking Corporation and SBC Warburg.</p>
<p>The fiscal agent is the Chase Manhattan Bank.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
